] %}

{% quotes = [
  ["Remove weight. Keep the force.", "Good product work is often subtraction: less friction for the team, less noise for the user, less waste in the system."],
  ["One decision should move three layers.", "The strongest edits land in the interface, the architecture, and the business model at the same time."],
  ["The right fix leaves less behind.", "Not more panels, more toggles, more process. A cleaner shape, with fewer things to maintain forever."]
] %}

<article class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,calc(100%-2rem))]">
  <section class="grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-6 md:py-24">
    <figure class="relative md:col-span-5">
      <img src="/images/nick.jpg" alt="Nikolay Ostrovsky" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover object-top">
      <figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 max-w-56 bg-fire p-5 text-base font-black leading-snug text-white">Phuket, Thailand.<br>Building worldwide.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="md:col-span-7 md:pl-[clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem)]">
      <p class="mb-5 text-lg font-black text-fire">Full-stack architect · product operator</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-[10ch] text-[clamp(3.4rem,9vw,6rem)] font-black leading-[.88] tracking-[-.04em]">Nikolay Ostrovsky</h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[48ch] text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-2xl">Two decades inside products, finding the waste nobody meant to build and the leverage nobody bothered to name.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-8 border-y border-line py-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:py-20">
    <h2 class="max-w-[10ch] text-4xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:col-span-5 md:text-6xl">The best change removes more code than it adds.</h2>
    <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7">
      <p class="max-w-[58ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Useful when a product has started dragging its own history around: old decisions, extra layers, fallback flows, code nobody wants to touch. The first move is usually not expansion. It is a precise cut.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[58ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">That instinct shaped pharmacy ERP across 1,300+ stores, education and creator platforms, <a href="https://houseviser.com" class="font-black underline decoration-fire decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-fire">Houseviser</a> in Phuket, and <a href="https://nofins.com" class="font-black underline decoration-fire decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-fire">nofins.com</a>, where freediving became a calmer, clearer digital product.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-5 py-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:py-16">
    {% quotes.each do |quote| %}
      <blockquote class="border-t border-ink pt-5">
        <p class="max-w-[16ch] text-3xl font-black leading-[1] tracking-[-.03em]">{{ quote[0] }}</p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-[30ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ quote[1] }}</p>
      </blockquote>
    {% end %}
  </section>

  <section class="py-14 md:py-24">
    <div class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-5">
