      <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qnomVOrRcLFvJ3dISHwEGgQ_aEzKXytpmPF1eJyqAM0/edit?tab=t.0" class="min-h-11 border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-base font-black hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-white">Open CV ↗</a>
